  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Baani Livestock Fattening and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide support to a group of livestock farmers in Niger in order to increase the number of livestock fattened and sold through the union, in addition to value-add products the group produces like animal feed and salt licks.</narrative>
